  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You've learned how to drive an iceberg without dancing. Congratulations.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dances class feature, know the floeing step dance, ability to cast 2nd-level spells, Wis 12</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you stop performing the floeing step dance, if you created an iceberg with the ice floe active ability during your performance, you may expend a 2nd-level spell as a free action. If you do, you retain the ability to pilot your iceberg for the full duration of its existence.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You lose the ability to pilot your iceberg the moment you stop dancing.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
